{"Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x003BC4": "「聞き分けが悪いな。ま、そこも魅力的だが」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x003C04": "「僕の所へ来れば、/　その美しさと若さを保てるのに……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x003C57": "「その外見は実に好みだが、偽魂ではな……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x003C97": "「人界に染まり過ぎたな、青龍」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x003CC5": "「神に逆らう超機人は、百邪も同然……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x003CFF": "「ほう、やるね」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x003D18": "「さて、どこまで抵抗する気かな？」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x003D4C": "「ふむ……人間にしてはやるね」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x003D7A": "「ほほう、頑張っているね」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x003DA2": "「その力……バラルの神の下で使いたまえ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x003DDF": "「さて、気は済んだかい？」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x003E07": "「まあ、こんなものか」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x003E29": "「気や力の使い方にまだまだ無駄が多いな」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x003E66": "「クスハ、/　君はまだ才能に頼り過ぎた戦いをしている」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x003EB6": "「クスハ、もっと努力したまえ。僕が導くから」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x003EF9": "「フッ、白虎に選ばれただけのことはあるか」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x003F39": "「人である以上、その念にも限界がある」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x003F73": "「ふむ……君なら、いい闘仙になれるのだが」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x003FB3": "「いい強念を持っているね。だが、惜しい」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x003FF0": "「君は好みだからね、大目に見よう」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004024": "「僕の所に来れば、/　その美しさに磨きがかかるよ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x00406E": "「僕なら、君の全てを愛することが出来る」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0040AB": "「君は好みだが、仙道へ導くことは出来ない。/　惜しいな」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0040FE": "「青龍の力は、その程度かな？」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x00412C": "「操者の差だね、/　四神の力が拮抗していないのは」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004176": "「よく当てた。褒めてあげよう」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0041A4": "「それで終わりかな？」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0041C6": "「避けるまでもないか」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0041E8": "「あくまでも苦界であがく気か」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004216": "「む？　何か触れたか？」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x00423B": "「君の攻撃は、そよ風のようだね」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x00426C": "「今は限りある命なんだ、大切にしたまえ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0042A9": "「フフ……可愛いものだな」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0042D1": "「君の想いを受け止めたよ、クスハ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004305": "「クスハ……やはり、君はいい」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004333": "「クスハも君も、まだ人の道理に縛られている」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004376": "「なかなかの念だね。/　バラルに来るのなら、歓迎するよ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0043C9": "「どんな念を持っていようと、/　僕には影響ないんだが」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004419": "「ふむ……強い念だが、惜しいね」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x00444A": "「可愛い子に何をされても、/　腹は立たないけどね」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004494": "「フフフ……可愛いね、君は」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0044BF": "「愛でてあげよう、君の全てを」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0044ED": "「君は好みだが、尸解は不可能だ。残念だね」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x00452D": "「力が落ちたか、青龍？」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004552": "「それでは四神の名が泣くぞ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x00457D": "「遅いね」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x00458D": "「僕はここだ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0045A3": "「届かないね、それは」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0045C5": "「人の力は、そんなものなのさ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0045F3": "「雀武王には追いつけまい」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x00461B": "「当たらないよ、クスハ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004640": "「君の攻撃なら、受けてもいいんだけどな」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x00467D": "「君の念は届かない」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x00469C": "「無駄だね」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0046AF": "「無意味だったな」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0046CB": "「効きはしない」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0046E4": "「別の手を考えることだね」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x00470C": "「………」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x00471C": "「ここは見逃してやるよ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004741": "「まあ、こういうこともあるか」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x00476F": "「仕方がないな、ここは」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004794": "「遊びが過ぎたか」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0047B0": "「それほど困りはしない」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0047D5": "「では、僕も行くとしよう」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0047FD": "「僕が手を貸してやるよ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004822": "「手を抜いたのかい、光龍」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x00484A": "「泰北、後は僕がやろう」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x00486F": "「まだ僕がいるのさ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x00488E": "「邪魔するよ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0048A4": "「まあ、見逃すわけにはいかないか」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0048D8": "「貸しにしておくよ、光龍」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004900": "「まあ、守る必要はないだろうが……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004937": "「バラルの神に手出しはさせない」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004968": "「悲しいかな、人には限界があるのだよ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0049A5": "「さあ、肉の体を捨てるがいい！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0049D6": "「そこだな！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x0049EC": "「蛇頭光を受けたまえ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004A11": "「雀王機よ、炎火を放て！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004A39": "「焼き尽くせ！　雀王火焔！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004A64": "「舞い上がれ、雀王機！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004A89": "「滑空焔斬！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004A9F": "「朱羽箭！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004AB2": "「穿て！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004AC2": "「これを受けたまえ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004AE4": "「朱羽箭！　貫け！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004B03": "「舞え、雀武王！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004B1F": "「朱羅剣！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004B32": "「行こうか、雀武王！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004B54": "「万魔伏滅！　黒蛇刀！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004B79": "「三千斬！！」　", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004B92": "「緊縛咒！！」　", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004BAB": "「破斬！！」　", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004BC1": "「紅に染まりたまえ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004BE0": "「五行器、輪転！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004BFC": "「南夏極断！　黒蛇刀！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004C21": "「昇天！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004C31": "「太極陣、生結！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004C4D": "「縮地呑天！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004C63": "「さあ、受けたまえ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004C85": "「黒蛇刀！　五行獄！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004CA7": "「焔天大聖前朱雀避口舌」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004CCC": "「五行器、最輪転！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004CEB": "「雀武周天！　縮地呑天！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004D13": "「黒蛇よ、空を裂き、地を疾れ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004D44": "「雀武王が最終奥義！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/269.bmd|0x004D66": "「黒蛇刀！　五行烈斬！！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/270.bmd|0x0019D3": "「では、参るぞ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/270.bmd|0x0019EC": "「ワシの出番じゃな」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/270.bmd|0x001A0B": "「あえて苦難の道を選ぶか。それも善哉」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/270.bmd|0x001A45": "「さあて、どこまで耐えおるかのう」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/270.bmd|0x001A79": "「生々流転の輪を回すとするかのう」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/270.bmd|0x001AAD": "「いかなる意志も事象も、太極の内」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/270.bmd|0x001AE1": "「事に従うか、抗うか……/　お主らの思うままにするがよい」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/270.bmd|0x001B37": "「仙道に沿わぬか。それも善哉」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/270.bmd|0x001B65": "「善き実が結べば、それで良いのじゃ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/270.bmd|0x001B9C": "「無為自然、有為転変……いずれも然り」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/270.bmd|0x001BD6": "「参るぞ、青龍の操者よ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/270.bmd|0x001BFB": "「強念者よ、意のままに戦うがよい」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/270.bmd|0x001C2F": "「参るぞ、白虎の操者よ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/270.bmd|0x001C54": "「尸解をよしとせぬか。それも善哉」"}